Is it over? Has Midranda been defeated? Will we live in peace?
It was a very long battle, from the Invasion of Pillai until today. Much has happened. We suffered many losses, both we and the water people.
Our alliance with the water people was key to our victory. Now Zarad can guide the water people as a true leader: strong and kind.

Despite the tremors happening lately, I hope we have reached the peace we dreamed of.
I will keep the Magic Censer's flame burning to celebrate our victory. Thank you very much for everything.

As a reward, you will receive 12 stat points for each new level reached, from level 165 on.
